// SUITE: stages
// EXPECTED-FAIL — the G14 matrix wart, made normative: roundtrip and egraph
// both write conformance.matrix.matrix_yaml, so their composition must NOT
// commute (writes_disjoint is computed FALSE from corpus 023). XPASS (merge
// observed) means the write collision was removed — the wart is FIXED — and
// that change must be RATIFIED: re-declare stage write-sets in 023, retire
// this pin through the lifecycle (G10), never let it flip silently.
// provenance: G15 (ADR-0010); operands are declared stages — ground terms
equivalence matrix_write_collision {
    roundtrip then egraph
    <=>
    egraph then roundtrip

    guards {
        writes_disjoint = true
    }
}
